{
  "uid": "outdoor-airq-makine",
  "title": "outdoor-airq — Makine",
  "description": "Prometheus + node-exporter. DIKKAT: ic ice sanallastirma yuzunden metriklerin bir kismi bu kutuyu degil Proxmox ana makinesini olcuyor; panel basliklarinda kapsam yazili.",
  "tags": ["outdoor-airq", "sistem"],
  "timezone": "Europe/Istanbul",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Bu dashboard'daki degerler neyi olcuyor",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Kurulum uc katmanli: **Docker container -> Proxmox LXC (bu kutu) -> Proxmox ana makinesi**. `lxcfs`, `/proc/meminfo` gibi dosyalari **okuyan surecin cgroup'una gore** uretiyor. node-exporter kendi Docker container'indan okudugu icin bellek degerleri bu kutuyu degil kendi payini gosteriyor (olculdu: 7.99 GB bos derken kutunun gercek degeri 3.4 GB idi). CPU ve yuk ortalamasi ise hic sanallastirilmiyor, Proxmox ana makinesinin tamamini olcuyor (yuk 6.17 gorunurken kutudaki container'larin toplam CPU kullanimi %4 idi).\n\n**Guvenilir olan tek sey disk** — gercek dosya sistemi okundugu icin dogru.\n\nKutunun gercek bellek/CPU durumu icin `free -h` ve `docker stats` kullanin. Bunu Prometheus'tan dogru almak, node-exporter'i LXC'nin kok cgroup'unda calistirmayi gerektirir; Docker icinden mumkun degil."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Bos disk (/) — BU KUTU, guvenilir",
      "description": "Gercek dosya sistemi okunuyor, sanallastirmadan etkilenmiyor. df -h ile dogrulandi. Docker imajlari diski sessizce doldurur (infra#4).",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 7 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "node_filesystem_avail_bytes{mountpoint=\"/\",fstype!~\"tmpfs|overlay\"}",
          "legendFormat": "bos"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 10000000000 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 30000000000 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Disk kullanimi (/) — BU KUTU, guvenilir",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 7 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "node_filesystem_size_bytes{mountpoint=\"/\",fstype!~\"tmpfs|overlay\"} - node_filesystem_avail_bytes{mountpoint=\"/\",fstype!~\"tmpfs|overlay\"}",
          "legendFormat": "kullanilan"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": { "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 15 },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU kullanimi — PROXMOX ANA MAKINESI (bu kutu degil)",
      "description": "node_cpu_seconds_total sanallastirilmiyor; tum fiziksel sunucuyu olcuyor. Bu kutunun kendi kullanimi icin `docker stats`. rate() ile sayacin turevi aliniyor: sayac surekli artar, anlamli olan artis hizidir.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 13 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 - (avg(rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode=\"idle\"}[5m])) * 100)",
          "legendFormat": "ana makine %"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "custom": { "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 10 },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "text", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Yuk ortalamasi — PROXMOX ANA MAKINESI (bu kutu degil)",
      "description": "lxcfs loadavg sanallastirmasi Proxmox'ta varsayilan olarak kapali; deger tum fiziksel sunucunun yuku.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 13 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "node_load1", "legendFormat": "1 dk" },
        { "refId": "B", "expr": "node_load15", "legendFormat": "15 dk" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "custom": { "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 5 },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "text", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      }
    }
  ]
}
